window.products.push({"id":307271,"name":"ZOBIDO Comfy Home Office Task Chair with Wheels, Cute Modern Upholstered Velvet Seashell Back Adjustable Swivel Vanity Desk Chair, for Women, for Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718tK6fV2iS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Dimension Details - Product Size] 18.5*19.7*29.5~32.6 inches. Bearing Capacity: The firm structure can bear the weight of more than 330 pounds. Easy Installation: You can install the office chair easily and quickly with the attached installation guide. [Selected Premium Material] Velvet chair back is soft and suitable, and with the 360° golden chair leg, the chair can be moved to any place as you like. Golden rotatable wheels can effectively protect floor. [Ergonomic Design] the specially-designed curved chair back fits perfectly in people’s back profile and helps to support and protect your backbone. With a lifting function, this suitable office chair can be adjusted freely for an appropriate height. A thick and high-density foam pad can provide you with a seating area lager and more comfortable; you will never get tired even after you work for a long time. [Multiple Application Scenarios] The home office chair, in fashionable and simple style, is suitable for various scenarios like office, study, living room, bedroom, dining room, dressing room, etc. This is the best choice for your decorating a room or gifting to families and friends. [Great After-sale Service] We offer a fast response to customers, and please feel free to contact us if any problem arises in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718tK6fV2iS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOBIDO","source_asin":"B08X29NYGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X29NYGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X29NYGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":307272,"name":"Dreamfoam Bedding 10\" Ultimate Dreams Soft Latex Mattress, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TPudn7rAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Dreamfoam Bedding Ultimate Dreams 10\" Latex Mattress with a plush cover features 3\" of Talalay Latex foam that instantly contours to each unique curve of your body for exceptional, orthopedic support and pressure relief. The quilted cover has 1\" of super soft reflex foam. The Ultimate Dreams Latex Mattress also features 5.5\" of high density convoluted base foam for increased air flow and conformability. The luxurious resilience and feel has enhanced breathability. Talalay latex is inherently hypoallergenic, breathable and resistant to moisture and heat, delivering a cooler, more comfortable night’s sleep. The gentle conforming support of latex foam also alleviates the high pressure associated with tossing and turning while promoting better circulation—resulting in increased blood flow and oxygenation to help you wake up feeling recharged and renewed. Our 10” Latex Mattress comes in three firmness levels: soft (19 ILD), medium (28 ILD), or firm (36 ILD). All Dreamfoam Bedding mattresses are custom made in our local USA factory, using the highest quality materials. Our personal approach to designing, stitching and crafting is backed by a generous 10-year no hassle warranty. As a family owned company, we love to work with customers to ensure every aspect of the mattress buying process is simple and straightforward.  All Dreamfoam Bedding mattresses are Certi-PUR US Certified, which means they are made without ozone depleters, PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (“Tris”) flame retardants, mercury, lead, heavy metals, formaldehyde or phthalates regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TPudn7rAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamfoam Bedding","source_asin":"B00CP85T2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CP85T2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CP85T2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
