window.products.push({"id":307351,"name":"Aston & Arden Rayon Bed Sheet Set - 100% Rayon from Bamboo, Ultra Silky Luxury Sheets, Breathable, Absorbent Fabric, Cooling, Durable, Sustainably Sou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PGSrdE5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DELIGHTFULLY SILKY RAYON FROM BAMBOO: Rayon from Bamboo is a silky, soft breathable fabric, sensual against your skin, making it ideal for a tranquil bedroom retreat. Rayon from Bamboo is created by extracting cellulose from the core of the sustainable Bamboo plant and processing its super-fine fibers into remarkably silky yarn. SHEET SETS FOR CHIC BEDROOMS: Our luxury rayon from bamboo sheets elevate any bedroom to a lush space for rest, relaxation, and enhanced sleep. Slip under our silky soft sheets and drift off into a restful dream state. The natural temperature-regulating properties of rayon from bamboo promote a deep, comfortable night’s sleep, even for the warmest sleepers. RAYON FROM BAMBOO AND ECO-HEALTH: Sheets made with rayon from bamboo are hypoallergenic and naturally resist allergens. Bamboo is a self-sustaining plant that sprouts new plants yearly. It protects the environment and saves labor costs. Bamboo can thrive without irrigation with sufficient rainfall and generates up to 35% more oxygen as it isolates four times more carbon than hardwood trees. Rayon from bamboo is pH balanced, making it a must-have for those with sensitive skin. INSPIRED BY SERENITY: Our collection of calming earth tones includes misty blue, steel grey, almond cream, warm taupe, and bone white. Make a serene decor statement in any bedroom with Rayon from Bamboo sheet sets and refined home textiles from Aston & Arden. PEACE OF MIND: Rayon from Bamboo sheet sets are produced in an OEKO-TEX SteP Certified facility. This certification includes a comprehensive analysis and assessment of production conditions: chemical management, environmental performance, environmental management, social responsibility, quality management, and health protection and safety at work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PGSrdE5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BJ7Q57CT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ7Q57CT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ7Q57CT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
