window.products.push({"id":307393,"name":"Blow Torch, Butane Torch with Fuel Gauge, Refillable Torch Lighter with Safety Lock, Adjustable Flame, One-handed Operation, Kitchen Torch for Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5117Ix3N7CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transparent Fuel Gauge:Transparent fuel gauge for KULED kitchen torches, enabling you better control the progress of your gourmet cooking.The fuel gauge with MAX line prevents overfilling with butane. Equipped with a safety catch to prevent accidental ignition. One-handed Operation:With flame regulator and safety lock, the flame size can be easily adjusted with one hand. Press the black safety lock while turning on the fire, and the flame will keep burning. Makes cooking more convenient. Suitable for All Butane Gas Tanks:KULED blow torches are available for all brands of butane gas canisters. The box comes with a red adapter, so either long or short nozzle gas canisters can be easily filled. Versatility:Max temperature up to 1300℃/2372℉.Can be used for cooking and crafting processes such as grilling, melting cheese, baking, caramelizing cream, DIY jewelry, craft soldering and more.It can also be used for camping fires and fireplace ignition. Service Assurance:Provide professional after-sales service, 1-year warranty period for the creme brulee torch. If you have any questions after you purchase the product please contact us by email and will reply within 24 hours.(Products do not include butane gas)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5117Ix3N7CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KULED","source_asin":"B09LM6B9Q6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LM6B9Q6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LM6B9Q6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
