window.products.push({"id":307439,"name":"Pat's banneton proofing basket set of 2, sourdough bread making kit. 9.5 inch round + 10 inch oval shaped proofing baskets for bread baking with artis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G+L66X3mL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Amazing quality!great investment Will last you years Great quality great price FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS - Pat's Bread Proofing Basket QUESTION: Does it come with linen liner and dough scraper ANSWER: YES! Yes, Pat's dough proofing basket comes with a washable linen cloth, metal and silicone dough scrapers. Essential supplies for making bread at home. QUESTION: Why use high quality rattan vs. plastic or wooden brotforms ANSWER: Wicker rattan makes an ideal container as it allows the air to circulate around the dough and let it breathe. Natural cane baskets will give your loaves a beautiful pattern and last a . QUESTION: Which flour is best to use ANSWER: Your choice of flour really depends on what finish you want your bread to have. Some people use this bread starter kit with rye flour. It absorbs moisture well and gives your bread a good crust and pattern. Plain white flour is a good place to start but experimenting with flour is half the fun. QUESTION: Can I put the banneton in the oven as it bakes ANSWER: Definitely NO! These bannetons are used to rise your dough in preparation BEFORE it is placed in the oven. Once your dough has risen then you can continue as your baking recipe suggests. QUESTION: What is the linen cloth for ANSWER: The linen cloth is used to cover the inside of the banneton but not required. The linen liner provides less inchstickinessinch in-between the dough and basket. Your search for 'the ONEinch perfect bread proofing basket is finally over! We have supply of this best selling product. Grab yours today from exclusively.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G+L66X3mL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pat's","source_asin":"B09BQGVFNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQGVFNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQGVFNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
