window.products.push({"id":307590,"name":"Silk Pillowcase, Anvo Luxury 25 Momme 100% Pure Mulberry Both Sides Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin with Hidden Zipper, 1PC Blue Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+Pj8f5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔔BENEFITS OF SILK PILLOWCASES 🔥Silk pillowcases help you reduce facial wrinkles and dryness, since 100% natural mulberry silk features a much gentler and smoother texture, there is far less friction between the pillow and your hair. 🔥Silk pillowcases are beneficial for your skin as well, they won’t absorb the natural moisture (or your beloved nighttime moisturizer) from your face. 🔥With increasing age, so does our skin. The softer silk pillowcases texture could cause less friction on the face, which means it’s less likely to cause fine lines, wrinkles and those annoying creases you see in the morning. 🔔WHY CHOOSE THIS SILK PILLOWCASE? 🔥MILLIONS+ HAPPY CUSTOMERS. ✅100% Pure Natural Mulberry Silk, both side 25 momme, 600 thread count. ✅OEKO-TEX Standard 100 Certified. ✅Hypoallergenic, breathable, comfortable, smooth, soft, cool. ✅Moisture keeping and facial wrinkle reducing. ✅Benefits for your hair and skin. ✅Natural temperature regulator. ✅Exquisite craftsmanship and durable. 🔔What You Will Get: 1 X Silk Pillowcase 🔔INSTRUCTIONS FOR WASHING AND CARE ✅Hand wash gently in cold water or lukewarm water with mild detergent. Backside washing and dry recommended. ✅Machine wash in cold, gentle cycle or silk mode below 30℃ with mesh protective bags ✅Wash separately from other items to avoid color mixing. Lay fat at a shady place and air dry. ✅Do not bleach and do not tumble dry. Do not twist or wring, Hang dry.Do not dry in direct sunlight. ✅Ironing is not recommended. If you must, only iron the inside of the silk pillowcase with the suitable temperature only. 🎁GREAT GIFTS FOR FAMILIES AND FRIENDS 1. Great gift choices for mom, wife, grandma, girlfriend, sister or adult daughters and everyone you care. 2. We recommend buying 2 or more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+Pj8f5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anvo","source_asin":"B08S7HK17H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7HK17H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7HK17H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
