window.products.push({"id":307657,"name":"MOYMO Reversible Sofa Covers for Dogs,Couch Covers for Dogs,Sofa Slipcover,Couch Covers for 3 Cushion Couch,Sofa Covers for Living Room,Couch Protecto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bLz7tuNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Measure before ordering. Refer to our measuring guide in our photos. You should know that sofa Covers are going to make cleaning up messes much easier. Whether your dog urinates or eats on the couch, they’re going to create a mess. With a cover, you’ll be able to fix the problem quickly and conveniently. Why We Need a sofa Cover Sofa covers for dogs is an awesome way to keep your sofa protected, and can also double as a decorative piece. If you are paranoid about your sofa getting stains from food and kiddos or getting clawed and torn up by pets, a sofa cover is the perfect way to keep your sofa protected. Or, if you have an older sofa that needs a fresh look, a reversible sofa cover can make the sofa feel like new again. MOYMO Furniture Protectors Are The Great Choice Which You can’t refuse - sofa cover side pockets: Our sofa covers have 2 big and 4 small pockets for storing magazines,newspapers,remotes and other small essentials, they’re always close at hand when you’re lounging out. - Straightforward To Use: One-piece design that put on and off with ease. The sofa Covers with 2\" wide adjustable elastic straps which will make sofa covers more tight. - Easy change,easy wash: Quilted slipcovers are made of Polyester material which will prevent spilling and stain.Easy to throw into the washing machine to clean. - Guarantee: 0 risk.Any questions,anytime for this sofa cover can be solved by our MOYMO Customer Service Specifications: - Sofa Cover Size:76”x130”(Arm to Arm) - Color: Black/Dark Grey Dark Grey/Grey Navy Blue/Brown Chocolate/Beige Burgudy/Beige - Sofa Cover Weight:3.10lb Package Contents: - 1 x Sofa Cover - 1 x Strap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bLz7tuNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOYMO","source_asin":"B07QYR77Y7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QYR77Y7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QYR77Y7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
