window.products.push({"id":307858,"name":"Summer&Kiss 3 Pack Glass Carafe Pitcher with Wood Lids and Tags, 1 Liter Water Pitcher, Beverage Carafe Set for Mimosa Bar, Juice Container for Brunch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d9u6P1qBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT VALUE SET - Glass pitcher set contains 3 x 1L carafe pitchers, 3 x wooden caps and 3 x wooden chalkboard tags. At 10.4 inches tall and 3.6 inches wide, the carafe is sized to fit refrigerator doors and mezzanines. The 1 liter capacity of the water carafe is enough to meet the needs of daily life. The design of the water pitcher is beautiful and elegant, with a narrow neck that is easy to hold, and a larger mouth for easy filling and pouring, and to avoid messy liquid spills. PREMIUM MATERIAL - This glass carafe with lid is made of high quality clear thick glass, compared to other fragile juice carafes, our glass water carafe is more durable and has good shatter and crack resistance, does not contain BPA and lead, dishwasher safe and easy to clean. These glass water carafes for refrigerator, kitchen, living room, bedroom bedside. Plus, our carafe can also be used to store food or as decorations like vases.（TIPS: This carafe is not suitable for boiling hot water） DURABLE WOOD LIDS - The glass carafe set contains 3 lids made of high quality wood with removable silicone rings and are completely BPA free and lead free. Compared to other plastic lids and acrylic lids, our wood lids are thicker, more durable, and seal better. The silicone ring on the wooden cover not only makes the wooden cover tightly fit with glass water pitcher to prevent dust from entering, but also effectively prevents the liquid in the juice jar from overflowing. WIDE RANGE OF USES - Our glass carafe is widely used in daily life. In addition to this, it can also be used in mimosa bars, parties, holidays, gatherings, anniversary. You can use these carafes to make cold coffee, milk, juice, water, lemonade, iced tea, cocktails or any homemade drink for daily drinking. The pitchers for drinks is also an excellent choice for birthday, wedding, Christmas or other holidays as a gift. QUALITY AFTER SALES SERVICE - We always focus on customer experience and are committed to providing quality customer service. Summer&Kiss carafe set for mimosa bar is packed in thick foam to avoid product breakage in transit. If you have any questions or are not satisfied with our glass pitcher with lid, please feel free to contact us. We will reply you promptly and offer you the perfect solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d9u6P1qBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Summer&Kiss","source_asin":"B0BJK2B6RK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJK2B6RK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJK2B6RK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
