window.products.push({"id":307928,"name":"Unique Non removable UV Printing, Holiday Edition, Storage Bag Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, 4 Separate Baggie Organizers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51574CkW3UL._AC_.jpg","description":"The only UV Printed Storage Bag Organizer: Bamboo drawer organizer for kitchen, fit most food storage bags, this separate baggie organizer is specially designed to fit most food storage and freezer bag brands, compatible with gallon, small quart, sandwich, snack and variety size bags, fit all your needs. Kitchen drawer organizer, compatible with various brands ziplock bags. THE PERFECT HOLIDAY GIFT FOR All KITCHENS: Help your beloved ones keep their kitchen in pristine condition! Beautiful UV printing and a great package make it an ideal Christmas gift FROM MESSY TO TIDY: Are you frustrated with opening the drawers that had the ziplock bags as they would always cause the drawer to get stuck? Here is the solution. Cut the clutter and have a organized kitchen drawer with our baggie organizer.Your drawer will change to be a organizer’s DIMENSIONS AND USAGE: It features a wide opening with smooth edges as well as a sealed surface. It comes with 3\" height and 8.67\" quartz box, making it easier to retrieve the ziplock bags without scratching your fingers 100% NATURE BAMBOO AND CRAFTSMANSHIP: This plastic wrap dispenser with ziplock bag organizer is made of premium bamboo. Well-constructed quality and excellent craftsmanship make it more solid and durable to last for years. Bamboo is a great alternative to plastic as it is a renewable resource and it will add a warm, natural feel to the kitchen. GREAT VALUE PACK: This set contains 4 separate baggie organizer. (Size: 12 x 5 x 3 inches (1 pcs) for Gallon, 8 x 4 x 3 inches (3 pcs) for Sandwich, Small Quart & Snack). Each container is laser engraved & UV-printed with the labels for gallon, snack, sandwich, and small quart Ziplock Bags. You can put them in the kitchen drawer, countertop or storage room to store your food storage bags. According to your needs, decide to use them alone or in combination.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51574CkW3UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BWMB GROUP","source_asin":"B09XBSZ3NT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBSZ3NT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBSZ3NT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
