window.products.push({"id":307930,"name":"TIN Silver Plastic Kitchen Backsplash Wc-20 Wall Covering Fire Rated - 25ft. Roll Glue On,Nail On,Staple On,Tape On!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mmwUCInuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Faux Tin Decorative back splash Plastic wall coverings are easily installed with adhesive glue/contact cement. Tin like appearance at a much more affordable price. These wall-coverings will instantly & elegantly transform your kitchen or room! The rolls are 2 feet wide. One small roll will cover approximately 50 square feet. There will be a flat rate shipping fee of $24.89 for the 25 foot roll. Back splash 0.011\" thickness. Restaurant renovation, Bathroom remodel, office renovation, wall cover. INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS FOR PVC BACK SPLASH. 1.Measure the total length of the piece you wish to install. Cut the piece at the desired length, with regular scissors. 2.Fit the piece under the cupboards 3.Apply glue (contact cement) on the back of the back splash and on the wall (where you are going to attach it). We suggest Gel Contact Cement. 4.Let the glue dry till it become tacky and attach the piece to the wall, squeezing out all the air from behind the back splash. Each PVC backsplash comes in a roll; it is therefore recommended that you use either an object to hold down one side of the roll while rolling it out or have someone help you hold it on the other side to ensure ease and stability. You are done! Now you can cover the edges of a back splash with metal/wood/plastic edging and start enjoying your new backsplash!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mmwUCInuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"backsplashes decorative backsplash afordable","source_asin":"B00319NOPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00319NOPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00319NOPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
