window.products.push({"id":307966,"name":"J.A. Henckels Premiere Series Danube 45-Piece Flatware Set Plus Hostess Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31131K47DQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description From the makers of the world's finest cutlery, comes the J.A. Henckels Premiere Danube 45-piece flatware set. Classic styling, timeless European design and larger, elegant continental size will grace any table with style for years to come. Manufactured Amazon.com With the Premiere Series collection, Henckels brings its renowned cutlery expertise to the design and function of elegant flatware. The Danube line is a perfect example of the pleasing results, with its sleek, sophisticated look and comfortable utility. Crafted from heavy-gauge 18/10 stainless steel with 18 percent chrome for corrosion-resistance and 10 percent nickel for luster, the pattern has a gleaming mirror finish and satisfying weight. Its styling includes seamless lines from handle to working end, broad tines and bowls, and tapered tips. As might be expected, the knives are expertly crafted with finely honed, forged blades. A great way to start a Danube collection, this 45-piece set includes eight place settings, each with a salad fork, a dinner fork, a knife, a soupspoon, and a teaspoon. The accompanying serving set features a serving spoon, a slotted serving spoon, a serving fork, a sugar spoon, and a butter knife. All pieces are safe in the dishwasher and never need polishing. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 8 place settings, 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: dinner fork; salad fork; knife; soupspoon; teaspoon. Service set consists of: butter knife; sugar spoon; serving fork; serving spoon; slotted serving spoon. 45 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31131K47DQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B000HHSKBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-307966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HHSKBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HHSKBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
